# The worst case: P1 255 (endless) and P2 255 (full cascade) with a loud, sustained saw two octaves up (C5 on the FX
# track). Without a limit it would build up; the cascade drains into the damping and the tank limiter ducks the
# input, so the output stays below 0 dBFS.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2
track fx1
input saw 110 0.95
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C5 1 100
gain 1
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below -0.1
